      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Enter the King, Gloucester, Bishop of Winchester, Exeter, York, Warwick and Vernon; Suffolk, Somerset, Basset and others. To them, with his soldiers, Talbot.",
