      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VERNON.\nNow, sir, to you that were so hot at sea,\nDisgracing of these colours that I wear\nIn honour of my noble Lord of York,\nDar’st thou maintain the former words thou spak’st?",
