      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BASSET.\nVillain, thou knowest the law of arms is such\nThat whoso draws a sword, ’tis present death,\nOr else this blow should broach thy dearest blood.\nBut I’ll unto his Majesty, and crave\nI may have liberty to venge this wrong;\nWhen thou shalt see I’ll meet thee to thy cost.",
